		{
			description: [
				"&2&lFTB Chunks.&r"
				""
				"Chunk loading, tied to your FTB Team. Open the map (default key: &eshown in Controls&r), find your island's chunk, and claim it."
				""
				"A claimed chunk keeps ticking - farms, machines, mob grinders - even while you're off exploring or logged out entirely."
			]
			icon: "minecraft:filled_map"
			id: "22444C4EBB5BEB7C"
			rewards: [{
				id: "259BE6335A148EA3"
				type: "xp"
				xp: 30
			}]
			shape: "hexagon"
			size: 1.5d
			subtitle: "&7Claim your island"
			tasks: [{
				id: "0B0D3E7006620514"
				title: "Claim your first chunk"
				type: "checkmark"
			}]
			title: "&2FTB Chunks"
			x: 0.0d
			y: -1.5d
		}
		{
			description: [
				"&eForce-loading&r keeps a claimed chunk ticking even with nobody from your team online - the difference between a farm that runs while you sleep and one that pauses the moment you log off."
				""
				"&e&lThis is not optional in a pack like this.&r Sieves, smelters, mob farms, Powah reactors and every Create contraption stop dead in unloaded chunks. If you log off and come back to an empty output chest, this is almost always why."
				""
				"&e&lHow to do it:&r press &bM&r for the map, drag to &7claim&r chunks, then &7ctrl+click&r (or shift+click) to force-load the ones that matter. Claimed and force-loaded are &lnot&r the same thing - claiming only sets ownership."
				""
				"&c&lForce-load sparingly.&r Every force-loaded chunk is a chunk the server ticks forever, whether you are online or not. Load your machine room and your farms; do not blanket-load your whole island."
				""
				"&7You have a limited allowance of both claims and force-loads. Check the counter in the top corner of the map screen.&r"
				""
				"&8If a force-loaded farm still stalls, the usual culprit is the machine sitting on a chunk border with half of it outside the loaded area."
			]
			icon: "minecraft:redstone_torch"
			id: "5E35775F56D7A7F3"
			rewards: [{
				id: "50DAF491C1044C1F"
				type: "xp"
				xp: 30
			}]
			subtitle: "&7Keep it running while you're gone"
			tasks: [{
				id: "29734A180C8864E0"
				title: "Force-load a chunk"
				type: "checkmark"
			}]
			title: "&2Force Loading"
			x: 0.0d
			y: -3.0d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["22444C4EBB5BEB7C"]
			description: [
				"&eFTB Teams&r groups players so claims, force-loads and quest progress are shared."
				""
				"&7Create or join a team from the team GUI. Everything claimed by any member is accessible to all of them.&r"
				""
				"&8Quest completion is per-team by default in this pack, so joining a team mid-game inherits progress."
			]
