		{
			description: [
				"&bM&r opens the world map, &bJ&r toggles the minimap, &bB&r drops a waypoint."
				""
				"&7Xaero's minimap and world map are both installed and share waypoints. Waypoints work across dimensions, which matters once you have bases on four planets.&r"
				""
				"&8The FTB Chunks claim screen is a separate map - check your keybinds if the two are confusing you."
			]
