				"You have a limited number of claims and a smaller number of force-loads."
				""
				"&c&lForce-load only what must run while you are away&r - sieves, smelters, farms, reactors. Everything else can sit unloaded."
				""
				"&7The counter is in the corner of the claim screen. If a farm stops working while you are elsewhere, this is the first thing to check.&r"
